This product is a demonstration application built for the SUSE Virtualization
rodeo. "Vertex Trust Bank" is a fictional company used for storytelling in the
lab. Nothing here is a real banking system and no metric shown represents real
financial data.

This application is built on open source components including Node.js and
SUSE BCI (Base Container Images), each subject to its own license terms.
